SUMMARY:Outside concert 80 at Greenfield 
DESCRIPTION:Meet People Lancaster\nThe music starts at 730pm.food trucks w
 ill be open at 5pm I am planning on getting there at 530pm and find a good
  spot for us to join the music.80s era\ndynamic performers like Whitney jo
 urney madanna prince and bon jovi.i will post a picture were we are at and
  what I am wearing.south Central pa single group will be joining us
